Subject: [PATCH] share original frontend resource context completion
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Share original package state5/queue/creation order, resource context switches,
resource Update removal/completion scheduling and the actual empty completion
body. Preserve the console bodies in their original branch. Native callers
require retained validated registration leases and explicit
creation services. This does not relocate Wii data, select the complete original
frontend managers or manufacture full concrete SceneCreated readiness.

